<title>USA: Suburban Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 full results.</title>
<headline>Suburban Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months</p>
<p>							Ended September 30,</p>
<p>							    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Interest  Income				   $3,903     $3,808</p>
<p> Interest Expense				    2,382	2,334</p>
<p> Net Int. Inc. Before  Provision		 1,521	1,474</p>
<p> Provision for Loan Losses			    --	   --</p>
<p> Net Int. Inc. After Provision		   1,521	1,474</p>
<p> Noninterest Income				    161	  122</p>
<p> Noninterest Expense(A)			    2,083	1,054</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense (Benefit)		    (130)	  193</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)				  ( 271)	  349</p>
<p> EPS(A)(B)					   ( 0.19)	 0.24</p>
<p> Return on Average Assets			(0.52)%	0.70%</p>
<p> Return on Average Equity			(4.22)%	5.30%</p>
<p> Net Interest Margin				 2.97%	3.02%</p>
<p> Financial Condition at Period Ended:  Sep 30,	  Jun 30,</p>
<p>						     1996		1996</p>
<p> Total Assets				 $209,942	 $202,057</p>
<p> Total Loans, Net			    167,408	  158,728</p>
<p> Allowance for Loan Losses		   3,133	    3,138</p>
<p> Available for Sale Securities	    28,296	   29,479</p>
<p> Real Estate Acquired by Foreclosure	 200		200</p>
<p> Deposits					124,420	  119,691</p>
<p> Borrowed Funds				 56,544	   54,027</p>
<p> Stockholders' Equity(B)		    25,386	   25,721</p>
<p> Nonperforming Assets to Total Assets    0.04%	    0.13%</p>
<p> Loan Loss Reserve to Total Loans	  1.84%	    1.94%</p>
<p>Average Interest Earning Assets to</p>
<p>   Average Interest Bearing Liabilities   114%	     114%</p>
<p> Stockholders' Equity to Assets	    12.1%	    12.7%</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding (000's)	1,429	    1,465</p>
<p> Book Value per Share(B)		     17.76	    17.56</p>
<p>(Dollars in Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>(A) Includes a $822,000 pretax charge for a one time special assessment to capitalize the SAIF fund.  After tax the charge was $555,000.</p>
<p>(B) As of September 30, and June 30, 1996 the Company had purchased 106,778 shares of treasury stock as part of the stock repurchase plan.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Suburban Bancorporation Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
